---

<div class="project-details">
  <h2>Vocabulary Dojo — AI-Powered iOS Vocabulary Training App</h2>

  <p>
    Vocabulary Dojo is an iOS application designed to help users build and
    retain vocabulary through structured flashcards and focused repetition. The
    project was fully conceived, designed, developed, deployed, and published by
    me end-to-end, covering product design, mobile development, backend
    architecture, infrastructure, and App Store delivery.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
    Role: Solo Developer / Product Designer / Backend Engineer<br />
    Platform: iOS (App Store)<br />
    Period: 2024
  </p>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <h3>End-to-End Ownership & Responsible AI Usage</h3>

  <p>
    Vocabulary Dojo is a fully independent project where I owned the complete
    lifecycle of the product. I leveraged AI tools during both the design and
    development phases to accelerate ideation, validate approaches, and explore
    alternatives — while maintaining full responsibility for the final
    implementation.
  </p>

  <p>
    As a responsible developer, I reviewed, refined, and validated every design
    decision and every line of code before shipping to production, ensuring
    correctness, security, maintainability, and long-term scalability.
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>
      Designed the complete UX/UI in <strong>Figma</strong>, using AI-assisted
      exploration to iterate quickly while retaining final design ownership.
    </li>
    <li>
      Developed and published the native iOS application, handling App Store
      certificates, TestFlight, provisioning, and release management.
    </li>
    <li>
      Architected and implemented a production-ready backend API using
      <strong>Go (Golang)</strong>, with clean architecture principles and
      strict code review standards applied throughout.
    </li>
    <li>
      Built the public landing and marketing website using <strong>Astro</strong
      >, optimized for performance, accessibility, and SEO.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <h3>Technical Overview</h3>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>iOS Application:</strong> Native iOS app focused on fast interactions,
      smooth animations, and a distraction-free learning experience.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>AI-Powered Flashcards:</strong> Integrated AI to generate
      <strong>real-time flashcard content</strong> tailored to user input, supporting
      <strong>12 different languages</strong>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Backend API:</strong> RESTful API built with <strong>Go</strong>,
      following clean architecture patterns and designed for performance and
      scale.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Authentication & Security:</strong> JWT-based authentication, strict
      input validation, sanitization, and defensive middleware.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Database:</strong>
      <strong>MongoDB</strong> for flexible storage of users, flashcards, and learning
      data.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Observability:</strong> Production monitoring with
      <strong>Prometheus</strong> and <strong>Grafana</strong>, including custom
      metrics, logging, and graceful shutdowns.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Infrastructure:</strong> Fully Dockerized services with separate development,
      staging, and production environments and Traefik routing.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <h3>Key Features</h3>

  <ul>
    <li>
      AI-generated flashcards created on demand based on user goals and language
      selection.
    </li>
    <li>
      Support for 12 languages, enabling multilingual vocabulary training.
    </li>
    <li>Secure user authentication and account management.</li>
    <li>Flashcard CRUD operations with validated and sanitized inputs.</li>
    <li>Scalable backend with production-grade monitoring and logging.</li>
    <li>
      Lightweight, high-performance landing page for product discovery and
      onboarding.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <p class="mb-4">
    <strong>Key Skills:</strong> iOS Development, Go (Golang), AI Integration, REST
    APIs, MongoDB, Docker, Prometheus, Grafana, Astro, Figma, Product Ownership, App
    Store Deployment.
  </p>

  <p class="mb-3">
    <strong>Why this project matters:</strong> Vocabulary Dojo demonstrates my ability
    to responsibly leverage AI as a productivity multiplier while maintaining full
    technical ownership. It showcases end-to-end product thinking, backend engineering
    depth, AI integration, infrastructure awareness, and the discipline required to
    ship a reliable, user-facing product independently.
  </p>

  <p>
    This project reflects how I build software as a product — combining
    AI-assisted workflows, solid engineering fundamentals, and operational
    excellence into a cohesive, production-ready system.
  </p>

  <div class="project__gallery pswp-gallery" id="project__gallery">
    {
      images.map((image) => (
        <a
          href={image.src}
          class="image-wrapper"
          data-pswp-width={image.width}
          data-pswp-height={image.height}
          target="_blank"
        >
          <img
            src={image.src}
            loading="lazy"
            alt="Vocabulary Dojo screenshot"
          />
        </a>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <a
    class="button--primary mt-10"
    href="https://vocabularydojo.com"
    target="_blank"
  >
    Project website
  </a>

  <CloseModalBtn />
</div>
